# Always deploy to Vercel

After finishing app changes in this repo, commit (unless only secrets changed) and `git push origin` to `main` so Vercel redeploys. Do not wait to be asked.

Never commit `apps/api/.env`, passwords, or real `DATABASE_URL` values. Keep those in the gitignored local env file and in the Vercel project environment variables.
